duae litterae II ansam dederunt Catalogis contrahendi
ad biennium longiorem aetatem.</P> <P COM="0300">Omnes codices ab  <HI REND="ITALIC">a</HI>  ad  <HI REND="ITALIC">o</HI>  sunt XIIII; ex his plerique
dant pariter ann. 2, mens. 3 et dies 7, ut in
picturis, supplendis per IIX in annorum numero.</P></DIV2> <DIV2 SECOND=YES COM="0300"><HEAD COM="0300">XXVII.
