 <CAPTION COM="1538"><HI REND="ITALIC">Apud Peniam ex codice Cavensi</HI></CAPTION> 

 <P COM="1538"><HI REND="ITALIC">Num. 34. linea</HI>  4, in montem Siraptim.  <HI REND="ITALIC">lin.</HI>  9,
thermas Domitianas, quae usque, etc.  <HI REND="ITALIC">lin.</HI>  15, patenam
